[197.169366, "o", "Unexpected error loading module MSFind: HTTPConnectionPool(host='127.0.0.1', port=55552): Max retries exceeded with url: /api/ (Caused by NewConnectionError('<urllib3.connection.HTTPConnection object at 0x7f37a388c750>: Failed to establish a new connection: [Errno 111] Connection refused'))\r\n\u001b[92mRegistered module: ExploitFinder\u001b[0m\r\nSearches the ExploitDB database for exploits starting from a CVE number\r\n\r\n\u001b[92mRegistered module: VulnFinder\u001b[0m\r\nUses the public Penterep Api to search vulnerabilities based on vendor or product name and other parameters. Allows to filter by vulnerability type, CVSS score, or App Version\r\n\r\n\u001b[92mRegistered module: DeleteNode\u001b[0m\r\nDelete a TOSCA node from the template\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[0m\r\nAvailable nodes in TOSCA data:\r\n1. [\u001b[34mpts_compute\u001b[0m] \u001b[34mhost_10.0.2.1\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m{'os': {'name': 'Unknown'}, 'ip': '10.0.2.1', 'open_ports': []}\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n2. [\u001b[34mpts_compute\u001b[0m] \u001b[34mhost_10.0.2.11\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m{'os': {'name': 'Unknown'}, 'ip': '10.0.2.11', 'open_ports': []}\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n3. [\u001b[34mpts_compute\u001b[0m] \u001b[34mhost_10.0.2.15\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m{'os': {'name': 'Unknown'}, 'ip': '10.0.2.15', 'open_ports': []}\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n4. [\u001b[34mpts_compute\u001b[0m] \u001b[34mhost_10.0.1.1\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m{'os': {'name': 'Unknown'}, 'ip': '10.0.1.1', 'open_ports': []}\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n5. [\u001b[34mpts_compute\u001b[0m] \u001b[34mhost_10.0.1.10\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m{'os': {'name': 'Linux 4.15 - 5.6'}, 'ip': '10.0.1.10', 'open_ports': [3000]}\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
